        "confidence": "official"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "三尺玉海上自爆は、重さ250kgの玉が沖合400mで爆発し、直径600mの半円に開く",
      "source": {
        "url": "https://www.kumano-kankou.info/kumano-fireworks/highlight/",
